</div>
<div class="faq-answer-template--25195734794569__ss_faq_19_KtCk8H" style="display: none; height: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;">
<p>All items are dispatched from our warehouse within 48 hours of placing your order, during business hours. If you place an order on a Friday afternoon or over the weekend, it will be sent out on the next business day. We are closed on public holidays, so please take this into account when placing an order.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item-template--25195734794569__ss_faq_19_KtCk8H faq-nested-item" data-nested-item="faq_item_XJT7FH">
<div class="faq-tab-toggle-template--25195734794569__ss_faq_19_KtCk8H">
<p class="faq-question-template--25195734794569__ss_faq_19_KtCk8H">Where can I find a store?</p>
<div class="faq-icon-template--25195734794569__ss_faq_19_KtCk8H">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-plus" focusable="false" role="presentation" viewbox="0 0 24 24">
<path d="M6 12h6m6 0h-6m0 0V6m0 6v6" stroke="#000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
</svg>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-minus" focusable="false" role="presentation" viewbox="0 0 24 24">
<path d="M6 12h12" stroke="#000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
</svg>
</div>
</div>
<div class="faq-answer-template--25195734794569__ss_faq_19_KtCk8H" style="display: none; height: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;">
<p>Use our handy online tool to search for stores by zip code, city, or even browse stores on a map. You can find the store locator on our website.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item-template--25195734794569__ss_faq_19_KtCk8H faq-nested-item" data-nested-item="faq_item_YMxhQi">
<div class="faq-tab-toggle-template--25195734794569__ss_faq_19_KtCk8H">
<p class="faq-question-template--25195734794569__ss_faq_19_KtCk8H">How can I sign in to my account?</p>
<div class="faq-icon-template--25195734794569__ss_faq_19_KtCk8H">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-plus" focusable="false" role="presentation" viewbox="0 0 24 24">
<path d="M6 12h6m6 0h-6m0 0V6m0 6v6" stroke="#000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
</svg>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-minus" focusable="false" role="presentation" viewbox="0 0 24 24">
<path d="M6 12h12" stroke="#000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
</svg>
</div>
</div>
<div class="faq-answer-template--25195734794569__ss_faq_19_KtCk8H" style="display: none; height: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;">
<p>Navigate to the website's sign in page. This is usually found in the top corner, where you might see a "Sign In" or "Account" button.</p>
</div>
</div>
