</div>
</div>
<div class="faq-answer-template--25195734794569__ss_faq_19_KtCk8H" style="display: none; height: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;">
<p>Returning an item is easy! Just visit our Returns Portal with your order number and email to get started. There, you can initiate your return and choose your preferred method (mail-in or in-store return if available). The portal will guide you through generating a return label if applicable. For a smooth return, securely pack your items in the original packaging if possible. Finally, ship your return using the designated carrier or bring it back to a store depending on your chosen method.</p>
</div>
</div>
